" style=3D"cursor: pointer;">Raspberry Pi camera</h2>
<p>Sensors publish their observations to Lattice as entities, and can expos=
e a
live video feed and accept tasks that control their behavior. This sample a=
pp
integrates a Raspberry Pi camera with Lattice using the Python gRPC (Connec=
t)
SDK, presenting the camera as a stationary asset with an electro-optical (E=
O)
sensor.</p>
<p>The app runs as two systemd units on the Pi. A Python daemon publishes t=
he
entity at 1 Hz, registers a live <a class=3D"fern-mdx-link" target=3D"_blan=
k" rel=3D"noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.haivision.com/products/srt-secure=
-reliable-transport/">SRT<svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width=3D=
