<h2 id=3D"objects-cli" class=3D"max-md:pr-4" data-state=3D"closed" style=3D=
"cursor: pointer;">Objects CLI</h2>
<p>In Lattice, the <a data-astro-prefetch=3D"viewport" class=3D"fern-mdx-li=
nk" href=3D"https://developer.anduril.com/reference/rest/objects/list-objec=
ts">Objects API</a> provides a content-delivery
network service that enables resilient data storage at the edge. This sampl=
e app implements
a command-line interface that lets developers interact with the Objects API=
 for managing
files across the Lattice environment.</p>
<p>The Objects CLI provides a comprehensive set of operations including upl=
oading files with
customizable time-to-live values, downloading objects to specified location=
s, retrieving metadata,
listing objects with prefix filtering, and deleting objects from the store.=
</p>
